{
  "movie_id": 201100801,
  "subtitles": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "start_time": 0.4,
      "end_time": 3.0,
      "text": "*pant*... *pant*..."
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "start_time": 4.0,
      "end_time": 4.8,
      "text": "Don't you..."
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "start_time": 5.0,
      "end_time": 7.4,
      "text": "come near meeee!"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "start_time": 9.3,
      "end_time": 10.2,
      "text": "...!"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "start_time": 10.3,
      "end_time": 11.2,
      "text": "Rino, you're up!"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "start_time": 11.4,
      "end_time": 12.4,
      "text": "I've got this!"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "start_time": 20.0,
      "end_time": 20.8,
      "text": "I'll kill you!"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "start_time": 21.3,
      "end_time": 23.0,
      "text": "Where do you think you're standing?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "start_time": 23.5,
      "end_time": 25.2,
      "text": "Lowly, insolent maggots!"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "start_time": 25.5,
      "end_time": 27.8,
      "text": "Get your filth away from"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "start_time": 28.0,
      "end_time": 30.9,
      "text": "Her Majesty's throne!"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "start_time": 31.2,
      "end_time": 33.0,
      "text": "Like I said..."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "start_time": 37.1,
      "end_time": 41.0,
      "text": "That \"Majesty\" of yours is just a silly fake!"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "start_time": 41.2,
      "end_time": 43.0,
      "text": "Big Sis Shizuru is right!"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "start_time": 43.2,
      "end_time": 45.2,
      "text": "There's no point staying loyal to her!"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "start_time": 45.4,
      "end_time": 47.9,
      "text": "You're putting your life online without a veil!"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "start_time": 48.1,
      "end_time": 51.0,
      "text": "On the line to no avail, I think, Rino."
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "start_time": 51.4,
      "end_time": 52.8,
      "text": "Shut up!"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "start_time": 53.1,
      "end_time": 57.0,
      "text": "To me, Her Majesty is the most wonderful"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "start_time": 57.2,
      "end_time": 59.0,
      "text": "and magnificent person in the world!"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "start_time": 59.2,
      "end_time": 61.0,
      "text": "Hmm, this is a pickle."
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "start_time": 61.2,
      "end_time": 63.9,
      "text": "She's not listening to a word we say."
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "start_time": 64.9,
      "end_time": 67.9,
      "text": "The brainwashing thingy in the pocket dimension"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "start_time": 68.1,
      "end_time": 69.7,
      "text": "isn't active anymore, right?"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "start_time": 69.9,
      "end_time": 70.6,
      "text": "Right..."
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "start_time": 70.7,
      "end_time": 75.0,
      "text": "Rajraj and Daigo should have Spatial Leaped inside and destroyed it."
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "start_time": 75.4,
      "end_time": 78.4,
      "text": "But that cat-eared girl's brainwashing seems pretty deep,"
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "start_time": 78.6,
      "end_time": 81.4,
      "text": "so she might not snap out of it so easily."
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "start_time": 82.0,
      "end_time": 84.8,
      "text": "This magical offensive is beyond her own limits!"
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "start_time": 85.1,
      "end_time": 86.8,
      "text": "With her energies already depleted,"
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "start_time": 87.0,
      "end_time": 90.5,
      "text": "she is drawing on her own life force to fuel her spells!"
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "start_time": 91.0,
      "end_time": 93.0,
      "text": "Ummm... What does that mean?"
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "start_time": 94.0,
      "end_time": 95.8,
      "text": "It means..."
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "start_time": 96.0,
      "end_time": 99.2,
      "text": "a few more minutes of this will destabilize her entire body"
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "start_time": 100.2,
      "end_time": 101.5,
      "text": "and kill her!"
    }
  ],
